+# BLUE CURRENT V51.05.0 — RESTAURANT PILOT READINESS BASELINE
+
+V51 begins the operationalization phase.
+
+The objective is no longer to expand Blue Current horizontally. V51 proves that the platform can operate safely and coherently in a real restaurant.
+
+## V51.01–V51.05
+
+Adds a read-only Restaurant Pilot Readiness Baseline.
+
+For every authorized restaurant, Blue Current now evaluates required pilot prerequisites across:
+
+- restaurant/location foundation
+- floor tables and sections
+- reservation operating path
+- workforce roster
+- kitchen operating model
+- authorized access
+- technical activation preflight
+- V50 production architecture certification
+- pilot baseline and committed success criteria
+
+External live connectivity is surfaced as a warning rather than silently converted into readiness.
+
+## Go / conditional / no-go
+
+`GO`
+- every required pilot baseline gate passes for every in-scope restaurant
+
+`CONDITIONAL`
+- portfolio readiness is at least 75%, but one or more required gates remain open
+
+`NO-GO`
+- portfolio readiness is below 75%
+
+A system assessment is not permission to operate a pilot. Human go/no-go approval remains required.
+
+## Current authenticated Chefs baseline
+
+The untouched authoritative data reports:
+
+- status: `PILOT-BASELINE-NO-GO`
+- decision: `NO-GO`
+- portfolio readiness: 42%
+- required gates: 19/45
+- blockers: 26
+
+Location baseline:
+
+- Marina Grille — CONDITIONAL — 78%
+  - technical preflight open
+  - pilot success contract open
+
+- Harbor House — NO-GO — 33%
+- River & Rail — NO-GO — 33%
+- The Cabin — NO-GO — 33%
+- Garden Social — NO-GO — 33%
+
+The four 33% locations currently lack the floor, reservation, workforce, kitchen, technical-preflight, and pilot-success evidence required by the baseline.
+
+Upstream architecture remains certified:
+
+- V49 architecture: 5/5
+- V50 architecture: 5/5
+
+Current upstream execution state:
+
+- V49: `V49-ARCHITECTURE-CERTIFIED`
+- V50: `V50-ARCHITECTURE-CERTIFIED`
+- pilot proof: `baseline-required`
+- technical activation: `activation-plan-required`
+
+This is exactly the purpose of V51: expose the real operational gaps rather than calling architecture completion pilot readiness.
+
+## Safety
+
+- assessment read-only
+- no synthetic readiness
+- warnings never become passes
+- human go/no-go required
+- automatic configuration false
+- automatic deployment false
+- automatic go-live false
+- autonomous production changes false
+
+## Validation
+
+- V51.05 focused lifecycle PASS
+- V50.30 regression PASS
+- authenticated pilot readiness endpoint PASS
+- authoritative database unchanged
+- undefined module exports: 0
+- duplicate HTML IDs: 0
+- npm run check PASS
+- 920 JavaScript files
+- 772 client scripts
+- 5,758 unique HTML IDs
+
+## Next
+
+V51.06–V51.10 — Restaurant Day Lifecycle:
+
+OPENING → PRE-SHIFT → RESERVATIONS → SEATING → ACTIVE SERVICE → KITCHEN COORDINATION → GUEST RECOVERY → CLOSING
+
+The next wave will evaluate whether Blue Current's existing operating surfaces form one coherent restaurant-day workflow.
